WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.000
I run in there screaming,

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:04.080
I throw a chair through the two sided mirror, glass goes everywhere.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.860
He's like, If Mad Dog Peralta will do that, who knows what else he's capable of?

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.650
No offense, but you don't get angry well.

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:10.840
What?

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.460
That's not true.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.160
Remember how angry I got about how fast Daenerys got from Dragonstone to north of the Wall?

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:15.660
That was intense.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.960
You have a boyish face and a big goofy grin.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.280
It's like being yelled at by a children's cereal mascot.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.700
Hey, some of those are scary.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.160
Count Chocula much?

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.040
All right, fine, I see your point.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:25.640
What do you suggest?

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:26.960
Let's get all up in his personal space.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.060
Make him feel uncomfortable.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:28.820
Okay, fine.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.000
Let's get intimate.

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:36.780
So, Philip, you're hanging out at the bar with Dana.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.460
How late did you stay?

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.060
I got in the cab around 3: 30.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.560
Kinda hard to find a cab in that neighborhood.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:42.880
Why not a ride sharing service?

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.040
Didn't have my phone, remember?

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.040
Did you talk to the driver?

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:45.620
No.

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:46.520
What route did you take?

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.180
I don't know, I was watching Taxi TV.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:48.960
What was I on?

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:49.680
Fallon highlights.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:50.460
What was he doing?

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:51.560
Slow jamming the news.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:52.500
Who was the guest?

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:53.420
Amy Adams.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:54.100
Who's that?

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:54.780
Famous actress.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:57.580
Why would you.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:57.880
Wow.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:00.680
You got some old silver fillings in there.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.070
You probably want to drill those out, and replace em with porcelain.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:03.860
Okay, but why.

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:05.980
And that is some serious plaque buildup.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:06.900
Let's get back to.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:07.060
it.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:07.400
No, no, no.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:07.840
Open wider.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:08.380
Let me see.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.000
Good God, when is the last time you had a cleaning?

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:12.600
Damn it!

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:15.460
Not only did we not break him, but now I have to go to the dentist?

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:17.240
We need a new strategy.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:20.680
And all this dental talk has given me an idea.

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:22.320
Okay.

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.280
We have a few more questions for you, doctor.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:25.460
Doctor.

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:26.020
Huh.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.960
It's funny when people call dentists doctor.

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:29.760
We are doctors.
